From: logdog2325 <226450061+logdog2325@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 23:21:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 165/166] XD Netplay: crash-safe team restores, team logging,
 Share Log writes the live log

A stash of an earlier save (the host's team under a guest's injected team, an import under a
netplay disposable) used to be put back blindly, at room close or after a crash at the next
session boundary, so a team the player set in between (Team Editor, Submit Team) was replaced
by the old one. Every such write now records the party it wrote (<marker>.party), and a restore
first checks the save still holds it; when the player changed the team since, the stash goes
back with the newer team carried over (re-stamped to the stash's trainer) and nothing old wins.
Also: each 1v1 start logs every GBA save it boots (file, CRC, species) and every team
submission is logged; Share Log flushes the live session log first (desktop and Android); the
"last battle is still closing" refusal says to restart OrreLink when it keeps happening.
